# About Me

I'm a software developer with interests spanning programming, game development, and technology. When I'm not coding, you'll find me reading books, playing games, or exploring new ideas.

## What I Do

I enjoy working on various programming projects and sharing my thoughts through writing. This site serves as a place to document my journey, share insights, and connect with others who have similar interests.

## Interests

- **Programming** - Always learning new languages, frameworks, and techniques
- **Games** - Both playing and thinking about game design and development
- **Books** - Fiction, non-fiction, technical books - I read across many genres
- **Technology** - Keeping up with trends and exploring new tools

## Get in Touch

Feel free to reach out if you'd like to discuss any of the topics I write about or if you have questions about my projects.
